    "sentence_translations": [
      "(5) Waiting for a Call",
      "",
      "It was now 8 pm on Thursday. In front of Old Guan was a phone. Old Guan was looking at the phone.",
      "At 8:30, there was no call. At 8:40, there was no call.",
      "Old Guan thought, “It doesn’t matter. It doesn’t matter. I’m not waiting for Little Dong’s call. I just want to see what time it is.”",
      "",
      "At 8:45, the call came.",
      "",
      "“Hello, hello!” Old Guan answered the phone. She was very happy.",
      "",
      "“Hello, Old Guan! I am Little Dong,” Little Dong said.",
      "",
      "Old Guan was very happy, but she only said three characters: “wo zhi dao” [I know].",
      "",
      "Little Dong said, “Old Guan, today I ate lunch, read a book, ate an apple, and now I am calling you on the phone.",
      "What about you? What are you doing now?”",
      "",
      "Old Guan thought, “I don’t want to say that I am waiting for your call.”",
      "",
      "Old Guan said, “I … I am watching TV.”"
    ]
